{"title":"Ashcaller Vigdis","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Ashcaller Vigdis is a named <a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\">Ashsworn Flamekeeper</a> seen at level 61.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find Ashcaller Vigdis</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 231, -1121</li><li>in the wilds around 228, -1125</li></ul>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"ashcaller-vigdis\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-dagger\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/76a2e17f4e9945d67b1f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5959181828b3928f61a4.svg\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Ashcaller Vigdis</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/ashsworn-flamekeeper\">Ashsworn Flamekeeper</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>61</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>1,386</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>125 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}